---
title: Vigenère cipher
tags: tools
---
{% from "macros/tool.njk" import toolSection with context %}
{% from "macros/tool-frame.njk" import toolFrame %}
{% set filename = page.fileSlug %}
{% set intro %}
<p class="px-2">
    One of the most well known cipher methods. Each letter of the message is shifted by a corresponding character of the key, running out of characters in the key will loop back to the beginning. For example: <code class="d-inline-flex px-2 bg-success bg-opacity-10 border border-success border-opacity-10 rounded-2">Hello</code> encrypted with a key of <code class="d-inline-flex px-2 bg-success bg-opacity-10 border border-success border-opacity-10 rounded-2">World</code> would shift like: 
    <code class="d-inline-flex px-2 bg-success bg-opacity-10 border border-success border-opacity-10 rounded-2">
        H &srarr; W &srarr; D
    </code> 
    <code class="d-inline-flex px-2 bg-success bg-opacity-10 border border-success border-opacity-10 rounded-2">
        e &srarr; o &srarr; s
    </code>
    <code class="d-inline-flex px-2 bg-success bg-opacity-10 border border-success border-opacity-10 rounded-2">
        l &srarr; r &srarr; c
    </code>
    <code class="d-inline-flex px-2 bg-success bg-opacity-10 border border-success border-opacity-10 rounded-2">
        l &srarr; l &srarr; w
    </code>
    <code class="d-inline-flex px-2 bg-success bg-opacity-10 border border-success border-opacity-10 rounded-2">
        o &srarr; d &srarr; r
    </code>
    - for the next letters, the key would loop back and start from the W in World again. There is more information available on the <a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Vigen%C3%A8re_cipher" class="text-convrtr">Vigenère cipher</a> Wikipedia page. 
</p>
{% endset %}
{% call toolSection(intro) %}
{% call toolFrame(filename, "Vigenère cipher", placeholder = "Example: Hello → World [key] → Dscwr") %}
<div class="input-group w-auto">
    <label class="input-group-text" for="{{ filename }}Key"><span class="visually-hidden">Vigenère </span>Key</label>
    <input type="text" class="form-control" id="{{ filename }}Key" autocomplete="off" aria-describedby="{{ filename }}Status">
    <button class="btn btn-convrtr" type="button" id="{{ filename }}Encrypt" aria-pressed="true">Encrypt</button>
    <button class="btn btn-outline-convrtr" type="button" id="{{ filename }}Decrypt" aria-pressed="false">Decrypt</button>
</div>
{% endcall %}
{% endcall %}
